  "prefLabel": "Env-A 102.41 Class A major source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 102.41 “Class A major source” means a major source with a maximum total heat input capacity of 1000 MMBTU per hour or more.\n\nSource. #6469-A, eff 3-5-97; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.66), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.41), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.42) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
